#: ../../source/workspaces/projects.rst:2
msgid "Add and Manage Workspaces"
msgstr "添加和管理工作区"

#: ../../source/workspaces/projects.rst:4
msgid ""
"A workspace is the project boundary used by Studio's file, Git, Godot, "
"and terminal tools. The agent cannot use a path outside the allowed "
"workspace roots simply because a model requested it."
msgstr "工作区是 Studio 文件、Git、Godot 和终端工具使用的项目边界。即使模型提出请求，agent 也不能因此使用允许的工作区根目录之外的路径。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/projects.rst:9
msgid "Add a workspace"
msgstr "添加工作区"

#: ../../source/workspaces/projects.rst:11
msgid "Open the workspace menu in the composer or workspace sidebar."
msgstr "打开 Composer 或工作区侧栏中的工作区菜单。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/projects.rst:12
msgid "Choose **Add workspace**."
msgstr "选择 **Add workspace**。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/projects.rst:13
msgid "Select the project directory."
msgstr "选择项目目录。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/projects.rst:14
msgid "Give the workspace a recognizable name and save it."
msgstr "为工作区设置一个易于识别的名称并保存。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/projects.rst:16
msgid ""
"For a Godot project, choose the directory containing ``project.godot``. "
"Studio can then resolve Godot project paths such as "
"``res://scripts/player.gd`` while keeping the real filesystem path inside"
" the configured root."
msgstr "对于 Godot 项目，请选择包含 ``project.godot`` 的目录。这样 Studio 就能解析 ``res://scripts/player.gd`` 等 Godot 项目路径，同时确保实际文件系统路径位于配置的根目录内。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/projects.rst:21
msgid "Multi-root projects"
msgstr "多根项目"

#: ../../source/workspaces/projects.rst:23
msgid ""
"A workspace can contain more than one source folder. This is useful when "
"a project is split across a game repository, a shared package, and a "
"tools repository. Mark the folder that identifies the project as "
"**Primary**, and keep each additional folder explicit so the agent knows "
"which paths are in scope."
msgstr "一个工作区可以包含多个源文件夹。当项目分布在游戏仓库、共享包和工具仓库中时，这很有用。将用于标识项目的文件夹标记为 **Primary**，并明确列出其他文件夹，让 agent 知道哪些路径在范围内。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/projects.rst:29
msgid ""
"If you add the same folder twice, Studio rejects the duplicate. Removing "
"a source folder from the workspace does not delete that folder from disk,"
" but it does change which files future tools can see."
msgstr "如果两次添加同一个文件夹，Studio 会拒绝重复项。从工作区移除源文件夹不会删除磁盘上的文件夹，但会改变后续工具可以看到的文件。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/projects.rst:34
msgid "Workspace tree"
msgstr "工作区树"

#: ../../source/workspaces/projects.rst:36
msgid ""
"The workspace tree helps you find sessions by state. Depending on the "
"current activity, you may see pinned, recent, running, archived, or "
"unread sessions. An unread indicator means a run completed or changed "
"state while you were looking at another session."
msgstr "工作区树可以帮助你按状态查找会话。根据当前活动，你可能会看到已置顶、最近使用、运行中、已归档或未读的会话。未读标记表示某次运行在你查看其他会话时完成或改变了状态。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/projects.rst:42
msgid "Renaming and appearance"
msgstr "重命名和外观"

#: ../../source/workspaces/projects.rst:44
msgid ""
"Use workspace actions to rename a workspace or change its icon and color."
" The appearance is organizational metadata; it does not change the "
"project on disk."
msgstr "使用工作区操作重命名工作区，或更改其图标和颜色。外观属于组织元数据，不会改变磁盘上的项目。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/projects.rst:49
msgid "Removing a workspace"
msgstr "移除工作区"

#: ../../source/workspaces/projects.rst:51
msgid ""
"Removing a workspace from Studio removes its registration from the "
"workspace tree and does not delete project files. Before deleting one, "
"check its session policy: sessions may be moved to another matching "
"project when possible, but unmatched sessions may be permanently deleted."
" Export important sessions or move them to a matching workspace before "
"confirming."
msgstr "从 Studio 移除工作区会将其从工作区树中注销，但不会删除项目文件。移除前请检查会话策略：如果可能，会话可能会移动到另一个匹配的项目；但无法匹配的会话可能会被永久删除。确认前，请导出重要会话，或将它们移动到匹配的工作区。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/projects.rst:58
msgid "Git and worktrees"
msgstr "Git 和 worktree"

#: ../../source/workspaces/projects.rst:60
msgid ""
"Studio can show Git changes for the current workspace and provides a diff"
" review surface. If you use Git worktrees, the **Worktrees** Settings "
"page can manage worktree preferences and cleanup behavior. Review the "
"selected root and automatic deletion options carefully before enabling "
"cleanup."
msgstr "Studio 可以显示当前工作区的 Git 变更，并提供 diff 审查界面。如果你使用 Git worktree，可以在 **Worktrees** 设置页面管理 worktree 偏好设置和清理行为。启用清理前，请仔细检查选定的根目录和自动删除选项。"
